
  Fenrir Linux live environment
  ---------------------------------------------------------------
  1. Get online
       Ethernet connects by itself. For Wi-Fi run:   nmtui
  2. (optional) Change the keyboard layout, e.g.:    loadkeys de
  3. Install Fenrir Linux:                           fenrir-install

  Test install in a VM (erases /dev/vda, asks only for a password):
       fenrir-install -c /usr/share/fenrir/examples/vm-test.conf

  Prefer doing it by hand, the Arch way?  All tools are here
  (basestrap, fstabgen, artix-chroot). Guide:
       https://github.com/FenrirLinux/iso/blob/main/docs/manual-install.md

